Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.60,HOOK,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)\t(0,220,\fs96)}WHAT WAITS\NWHILE YOU SLEEP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:02.05,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}YOU WILL SPEND TWENTY-SIX YEARS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.05,0:00:02.73,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}OF YOUR LIFE ASLEEP.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.73,0:00:04.50,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}HERE IS WHAT IS WAITING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:05.92,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}IN THERE WITH YOU.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:21.92,CHIP,,0,0,0,,#1  SLEEP PARALYSIS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.09,0:00:06.54,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}ONE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:07.61,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}SLEEP {\c&H0000FFFF&}PARALYSIS{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.61,0:00:09.72,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}YOUR BODY IS CHEMICALLY {\c&H0000FFFF&}LOCKED{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.72,0:00:11.15,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}SO YOU CAN'T ACT OUT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:11.63,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}DREAMS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.63,0:00:13.28,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}SOMETIMES YOUR MIND WAKES FIRST.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:14.44,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}YOU CAN'T MOVE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:15.55,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}CAN'T {\c&H0000FFFF&}SCREAM{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.55,0:00:17.18,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}AND A {\c&H0000FFFF&}SHADOW{\c&H00FFFFFF&} FIGURE STANDS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:18.11,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}AT THE FOOT OF THE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.11,0:00:18.56,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}BED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:20.96,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}EVERY CULTURE ON EARTH REPORTS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:21.79,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THE SAME {\c&H0000FFFF&}VISITOR{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:37.28,CHIP,,0,0,0,,#2  FATAL FAMILIAL INSOMNIA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.03,0:00:22.61,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}TWO.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:23.97,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}{\c&H0000FFFF&}FATAL{\c&H00FFFFFF&} FAMILIAL INSOMNIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.97,0:00:24.60,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}ONE NIGHT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:26.47,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}SLEEP SIMPLY STOPS COMING.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.47,0:00:27.59,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}NOT HARDER.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:28.35,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}{\c&H0000FFFF&}GONE{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.35,0:00:30.24,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}A {\c&H0000FFFF&}MISFOLDED{\c&H00FFFFFF&} PROTEIN EATS THE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:32.07,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}PART OF YOUR BRAIN THAT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.07,0:00:33.12,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}LETS YOU SLEEP.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:34.59,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}EIGHTEEN MONTHS LATER
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.59,0:00:36.03,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}YOU {\c&H0000FFFF&}DIE{\c&H00FFFFFF&} AWAKE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.03,0:00:37.16,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THERE IS NO TREATMENT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:37.56,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}IT IS {\c&H0000FFFF&}INHERITED{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:51.87,CHIP,,0,0,0,,#3  THE DROP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.39,0:00:38.21,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THREE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.21,0:00:39.21,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THE DROP.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.21,0:00:40.55,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THAT {\c&H0000FFFF&}JOLT{\c&H00FFFFFF&} RIGHT AS YOU
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:41.37,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}FALL ASLEEP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.37,0:00:42.87,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}LIKE FALLING FROM A HEIGHT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.87,0:00:44.72,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}YOUR MUSCLES FIRE AS YOUR
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:45.52,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}HEART RATE CRASHES.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:46.64,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}ONE THEORY: YOUR BRAIN THINKS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:47.43,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}YOU'RE {\c&H0000FFFF&}DYING{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.43,0:00:48.16,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}AND JOLTS YOU BACK.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:49.36,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}EVERY NIGHT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:51.75,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}IT CONSIDERS LETTING YOU GO.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:54.52,HOOK,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)\t(0,220,\fs96)}FOLLOW —\NPT.2 TOMORROW
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:52.86,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}FOLLOW.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.86,0:00:55.08,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}TOMORROW: THREE PLACES PEOPLE WALKED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:56.16,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}INTO AND NEVER LEFT.
